<div class="vm-shell" id="vmDesktop" data-resolution="1920x1080">
  <header class="vm-topbar"><div class="vm-brand"><span class="vm-mark">VM</span><b>VMDESKTOPREIC</b><span class="vm-sub">OS MEDIA VM · REIC DESKTOP</span></div><div class="vm-top-center">WORKSPACE / DESKTOP</div><div class="vm-system-status"><span class="live-dot"></span> OS MEDIA VM ONLINE <span id="vmClock">--:--</span></div></header>
  <main class="vm-workspace"><aside class="vm-dock" aria-label="Aplikasi desktop">
    <button class="dock-app active" data-app="home"><span>⌂</span><small>Beranda</small></button><button class="dock-app" data-app="files"><span>▤</span><small>File</small></button><button class="dock-app" data-app="registry"><span>▦</span><small>Registri</small></button><button class="dock-app" data-app="terminal"><span>⌘</span><small>Terminal</small></button><button class="dock-app" data-app="settings"><span>⚙</span><small>Pengaturan</small></button><button class="dock-app" data-app="monitor"><span>◫</span><small>Pemantauan</small></button>
  </aside><section class="vm-stage"><div class="vm-welcome"><div><p class="eyebrow">OS MEDIA VM / LAYER 01</p><h1>Ruang kerja digital.<br><em>Satu desktop terpadu.</em></h1><p>Lingkungan desktop REIC yang berjalan di atas sistem OS MEDIA VM. Resolusi kanvas logis 1920 × 1080, menyesuaikan ukuran layar perangkat.</p><div class="vm-pills"><span>1920 × 1080 LOGICAL</span><span>REIC RUNTIME</span><span>OS MEDIA VM CORE</span></div></div><div class="vm-orbit"><div class="orbit-ring one"></div><div class="orbit-ring two"></div><div class="orbit-core">REIC<small>DESKTOP</small></div></div></div>
  <div class="vm-desktop-grid"><button class="desktop-shortcut" data-app="files"><span>▤</span><b>File Manager</b><small>Folder &amp; berkas</small></button><button class="desktop-shortcut" data-app="registry"><span>▦</span><b>Registri Sistem</b><small>Komponen OS MEDIA VM</small></button><button class="desktop-shortcut" data-app="terminal"><span>⌘</span><b>Terminal REIC</b><small>Console workspace</small></button><button class="desktop-shortcut" data-app="settings"><span>⚙</span><b>Pengaturan</b><small>Preferensi desktop</small></button><button class="desktop-shortcut" data-app="monitor"><span>◫</span><b>Pemantauan</b><small>Status runtime</small></button></div>
  <section class="vm-window" id="vmWindow" hidden><header><b id="windowTitle">Beranda</b><div><button id="windowMin" aria-label="Minimalkan">—</button><button id="windowClose" aria-label="Tutup">×</button></div></header><div class="vm-window-content" id="windowContent"></div></section>
  </section></main><footer class="vm-taskbar"><span>OS MEDIA VM · REIC/1.0</span><span>Semua modul menggunakan lapisan sistem OS MEDIA VM</span><span>1920 × 1080 · <b id="vmDate">--</b></span></footer>
</div>